Warnings:
Note: The printed Across list has a clue 60, 'The human thing to do.', but the printed grid has no 60 Across: square 60 starts only 60 Down (Pot manufacturer), and 59 Across is the two squares before it. A misprint in the magazine; the clue is quoted here, since no entry can hold it.

